flowchart TD
    Start([Launch]) --> Resolve[Resolve application-relative data path]
    Resolve --> Load[Load JSON through repository]
    Load --> Valid{Valid data?}
    Valid -- No --> Error[Show error; leave file unchanged] --> End([Exit])
    Valid -- Yes --> UI[Display task list]
    UI --> Action{User action}
    Action -->|Search/filter/select| Display[Refresh list or context]
    Display --> Action
    Action -->|Create/edit/status/reopen/delete| Validate[Validate domain operation]
    Validate --> OK{Valid?}
    OK -- No --> Message[Show understandable error] --> Action
    OK -- Yes --> Save[Atomically save collection]
    Save --> Saved{Save succeeded?}
    Saved -- No --> Rollback[Roll back in-memory change and show error] --> Action
    Saved -- Yes --> UI
    Action -->|Close window| End

